1145		\uses{def:line-point-dist, def:povm-distance, lem:qld-4-10}
1146		The point marginal of the line-point distribution is uniform, and two
1147		independent line-point samples have independent uniform point marginals.
1148		For a joint point measurement, postprocessing by either coordinate gives
1149		the corresponding marginal sum. Adjoining an undefined answer with zero
