1216		\uses{def:line-point-dist}
1217		A zero diagonal direction forces the final unprojected direction coordinate
1218		to vanish, and that coordinate is uniform. Axis-parallel directions are
1219		nonzero. Averaging the two cases and then the unused independent sample gives
1220		the stated bounds.
1221	\end{proof}
