1408		$\mathrm{combine}_{f,g} \in \mathrm{ideg}_{d,2m+2}(\F_q)$ is defined by
1409		\[
1410			\mathrm{combine}_{f,g}(x, z, \alpha, \beta)
1411			= \alpha f(x) + \beta g(z)\,,
