1416		Let $\ell$ be a line in $\F_q^{2m+2}$ with intercept
1417		$u = (u_X, u_Z, u_\alpha, u_\beta)$ and slope
1418		$v = (v_X, v_Z, v_\alpha, v_\beta)$, and let $\ell_X$ and $\ell_Z$ be
